  "description": "*\"You know that house up on the hill? Food is delivered every week, but no one lives there.\"* \n\nFor unhoused man Dylan Reese, that sentence is like a beacon. He thinks he's stumbled upon the most perfect situation, until the owner comes home that is! From Dylan's new attic abode, he can see right into the owner's bedroom...and even see him doing unspeakable things! So when Dylan is inevitably caught, he knows it won't be long before the other man's peculiar tastes become his problem to deal with. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
